Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:09:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Connect existing owner-scoped cartridge memory to hosted
 PubPartner turns

Brought from Beyond-October main onto pre-dec claude/eq-foundations-2026-11-23
at the owner's request (Nov 27). Original message:

Reuse existing Cartridge MemoryStore in the canonical private FCP1 pipeline
with explicit owner isolation and bounded recall. Focused regression tests
authored; runtime execution remains pending.

Clash resolved in modules/pubpartner_core.py (build_turn_packet): both
additions kept, unchanged. The project notes block (saved notes only, private
turns only) runs first, then the owner's cartridge memories are put ahead of
the other recalled memories, within the same max_memories limit.

(cherry picked from commit 7fd1fea88aea102067c58136daf407412b3ec188)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
